# autopan regression seed — press W once to reach width_fx=1, which is
# autopan(2.0 Hz, depth 1.0, SINE). Gate:
#   node tools/play.js wavecandy script tools/clips/wavecandy/02-autopan.script \
#        --headless --frames 420 --wav /tmp/ap.wav
#   node tools/stereo-check.js /tmp/ap.wav --expect autopan --rate 2.0 --quiet
# Chosen over pedalboard because the pedal there needs a palette drag; here it is one key.
down 20 W
up 23 W
